# Turning Library into a Dirty Word: A Rant.

**Authors:** Broderick, Dorothy M.

## Abstract
A traditional librarian argues that there is no &quot;science of information&quot; and that librarianship belongs to the humanities not the sciences. Traces the replacement of librarians with &quot;machine people,&quot;&quot;digital theorists,&quot; and other &quot;off-the-wall types&quot; from the 1960s to the present. Proposes a course of action. (PEN)

